\Rightarrow \quad h v^{\prime} \text{ and } =-13.6 Z^{2}\left(\frac{1}{2^{2}}-\frac{1}{1^{2}}\right)\\
v^{\prime} \text{ and } =\frac{13.6 Z^{2}}{h} \times \frac{3}{4}
\end{aligned}$ In option (c), $n_{1}=2, n_{2}=6$, hence energy of emitted photon is given as $\begin{aligned} \text{ and } E^{\prime \prime}=-13.6 Z^{2}\left(\frac{1}{6^{2}}-\frac{1}{2^{2}}\right)\\
